---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Add Your Skill">

  <div class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">Add Your Skill to the Registry</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1 m-0">The registry auto-scans all navapbc repos every 4 hours. No manual submission needed — just add the right files.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Concepts -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4">What's the difference?</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Plugin</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed m-0">Your GitHub repository. One plugin can contain many skills and agents. It's the organizational unit — the "package."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Skill</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed m-0">A reusable prompt workflow (<code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-xs">SKILL.md</code>) for a specific task — like "debug-everything" or "write-tests". Invoked deliberately when needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Agent</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed m-0">A project-level AI config (<code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-xs">CLAUDE.md</code>, <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-xs">.cursorrules</code>) that sets baseline behavior for an AI tool across your whole project.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Steps -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4">How to add a Skill</h2>
    <ol class="space-y-6 list-none p-0 m-0">

      <li class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-plum-600 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Create a <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">SKILL.md</code> in your repo</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">Place it in any of these locations — the scanner finds them all:</p>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded p-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1">
            <p class="m-0">SKILL.md                          <span class="text-gray-400"># repo root</span></p>
            <p class="m-0">.claude/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md  <span class="text-gray-400"># Claude Code skills dir</span></p>
            <p class="m-0">.claude/commands/my-command.md    <span class="text-gray-400"># Claude Code commands</span></p>
            <p class="m-0">plugins/*/skills/*/SKILL.md       <span class="text-gray-400"># nested plugin structure</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-plum-600 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Add frontmatter at the top</p>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded p-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600">
            <p class="m-0 text-gray-400">---</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">name</span>: My Skill Name</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">description</span>: A one-line description shown on the card</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">compatibility</span>: [claude-code, claude-chat]</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">version</span>: 1.0.0</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">sensitive_data</span>: false</p>
            <p class="m-0 text-gray-400">---</p>
            <p class="m-0 mt-2 text-gray-500"># Your skill content here...</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-plum-600 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Push to your repo — that's it</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">The registry re-scans every 4 hours. Your skill will appear in the marketplace after the next sync. The "last committer" shown on the card is whoever most recently pushed the file.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- Frontmatter reference -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4">Frontmatter fields</h2>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide w-36">Field</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide w-20">Required</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide">Description</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">name</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">Yes</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">Display name shown in the marketplace card and detail page.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">description</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">Yes</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">One-line summary. Falls back to the first non-heading line of the file if omitted.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">compatibility</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">No</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">Array of AI tools this skill works with: <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">claude-code</code>, <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">claude-chat</code>, <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">claude-cowork</code>.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">version</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">No</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">Semver string. Defaults to <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">1.0.0</code>.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">sensitive_data</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">No</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">Set to <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">true</code> if this skill works with PII or other sensitive data. Adds a ⚠ badge.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Agent section -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">For Agents</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">Agent config files are auto-detected — no special file naming needed beyond what your AI tool already expects:</p>
    <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded p-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1">
      <p class="m-0">CLAUDE.md             <span class="text-gray-400"># Claude Code project instructions</span></p>
      <p class="m-0">.claude/agents/*.md   <span class="text-gray-400"># Claude Code sub-agents</span></p>
      <p class="m-0">.cursorrules          <span class="text-gray-400"># Cursor</span></p>
      <p class="m-0">.github/copilot-instructions.md  <span class="text-gray-400"># GitHub Copilot</span></p>
      <p class="m-0">GEMINI.md             <span class="text-gray-400"># Gemini CLI</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-6">
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Questions? Check the <a href="https://navasage.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/NH/pages/3137536013/FAQ+Claude+Skills" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-plum-600 hover:text-plum-700">FAQ</a> or drop by <a href="https://navasage.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/NH/pages/3140136126/AI+Office+Hours" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-plum-600 hover:text-plum-700">AI Office Hours</a>.</p>
  </div>

</Base>
